bound-lock/1 about="Connected to {place} from the package {package}: {sources} — every document and every pin as it names them. Nothing was granted with them: access is asked here, issuer by issuer." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.1g by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/received value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Desktop Extension exclusions applied by the native packager without changing installed dependencies" at=policy:head/bundle-exclusions/0.1.6 by=target form=alphabet measure=id needs=.mcpbignore role=demands scope=view/bundle-exclusions shape=.mcpbignore value=text
bound-lock/1 about="Do one action in a place, on the card ask answered for it: found a place, admit a device, land a lot ask planned, share a place, make this device-s key, prove access to a source, call an offer that is not a read, or keep what the person states as theirs. An action on a place that moved since its card was asked is refused, with nothing done; one the place does not allow is said not to be in the card. The answer ends with the card valid from this act." at=policy:head/claims/0.1.5 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=tool/do value=action|card|place|dir|name|key|coverage|lot|to|urls|who|source|operation|args|said|withdraw
bound-lock/1 about="Drafted lines, one a line, each by=target and unsigned: shown to the person and, on their yes to exactly those, signed by their key and folded as if landed. Nothing lands; the answer names the lot do lands." at=policy:head/verbs/0.1.4 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=tool/ask/lines value=string
