bound-lock/1 about="Its document: an https address, read with nothing attached and, named by its digest, followed wherever it moves to the bytes that digest names; or an absolute file inside the place or a folder the client shares; or a package-s lock, from either, with its digest. Or a site alone, such as api.example.com, its document found where the site publishes its catalog or at the paths head-s lock names; or a folder the client shares, its document found inside it at those names. A site or folder names the source when none is given." at=policy:head/connect/0.1.4 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=tool/connect/document value=string
