bound-lock/1 about="No retained read of {operation} on {source} is held here for whom it would be read as. Nothing was called." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/history-none value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="No world typed that answer, so nothing of it was kept to show; the receipt stands as evidence of the read." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/history-untyped value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Not kept: you said no to keeping what you state in {place} in this conversation. {said} was not kept." at=policy:head/claims/0.1.5 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/claims-declined value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Nothing kept in {place} is {said}: nothing was taken back." at=policy:head/claims/0.1.5 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/claim-none value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Nothing was admitted: hand the lines the other device-s key tool answered, and a name." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/no-key value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="One place by its folder, absolute; without one, every place." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.1g by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=tool/places/place value=string
bound-lock/1 about="One view of a place as bound folds it, for a client to hold beside the conversation." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=resource/view value=bound://view/{view}{?place,at}
bound-lock/1 about="Open this page on this device to answer: {title}. What you enter goes to head on this device, never through the model." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/answer value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Open this page on this device to enter what {title} asks for. Nothing you type passes through the model; only the secret it yields is kept, in your keychain." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/enter value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Pack a place for another place to receive: a lock naming by digest each world its sources were compiled under and each source-s document, overlay and compiled pin, written with those bytes into a folder — and, beside each digest, the encrypted address its bytes are also published at, where the person names one. It carries no key, no grant and no answer; nothing is asked, signed or landed. The folder or the addresses travel as the person chooses, and the digest apart, over a private channel." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.1g by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=tool/share value=place|to|urls
bound-lock/1 about="Packed from {place} into {to}: {sources}. Its lock names each by digest, beside the bytes it names. The package is {digest}: send it apart from the folder, over a private channel, and the receiver connects the lock by it. It carries no key and no answer, and grants nothing." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.1g by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/shared value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Pick the origin head reaches {source} at in this place, once. None is a default." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/pick value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Propose lines for the person to sign: they are shown to the person with the place and the base they are made against; on a yes to exactly those, the person-s key signs them and they are folded as if landed. Nothing lands; the lot is kept by its digest." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=tool/plan value=place|lines
bound-lock/1 about="Prove access to a source ahead of any call, the way its document declares: the person-s own page, or its provider with a client registered for the visit; the secret is kept in this keychain and a receipt lands without it. Nothing is called." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=tool/access value=place|source|operation
bound-lock/1 about="Prove access to a source the way it declares, ahead of any call: entered on head-s page or at its provider, never here." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=prompt/access value=place|source
bound-lock/1 about="Prove access to {source} in {place} with the do tool, as its access action. I will enter what it asks on head-s own page or at its provider, never here." at=policy:head/verbs/0.1.4 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=prompt/access/text value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Read one view of a place as bound folds it, at the resolution ask reads it at; or what a source offers, as typed lines: at 0 where it is reached and the class of each offer, past it their forms and how access is proven; or, with an operation of class read, that operation once: the response comes back with the receipt the device key landed for it, or, while the place allows reuse, the answer kept for it and nothing called. Nothing else is ever called." at=policy:head/verbs/0.1.4 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=tool/look value=place|view|source|operation|args|closes|history|why
bound-lock/1 about="Receive a package another place shared: from a file or an address, by the digest its sender sent apart from it." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.1g by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=prompt/receive value=package|digest|place
bound-lock/1 about="Receive the package {package} into the place {place} with the connect tool: its lock as the document, named by the digest {digest}. Ask me before you do, and tell me which sources it connected and that access is asked here again." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.1g by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=prompt/receive/text value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Several sources, joined by |, asked the same operation with the same arguments: what they agree on is marked by who says it, and what they differ on is shown from each." at=policy:head/marks/0.1.5 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=tool/ask/sources value=string
bound-lock/1 about="Share a place with someone: its sources, as a package they connect by its digest." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.1g by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=prompt/share value=place|who
bound-lock/1 about="Share the place {place} with {who}: pack it with the do tool, as its share action, into a folder I share, show me the package-s digest, and tell me to send {who} the folder — or the addresses it is published at — and the digest apart from it, over a private channel." at=policy:head/verbs/0.1.4 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=prompt/share/text value=lock
