bound-lock/1 about="head asks to connect to {place} every source the package {package} names whose bytes arrived, in its order: {sources}. Each is compiled here and held to the package-s pin; nothing the sharing place was granted comes with it. Waiting for their bytes, connected when they arrive: {open}. Say yes only to this." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.2 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/elicit-receive value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="head asks to connect {source} to {place} from {document} {overlay}: compiled once and pinned; nothing is called. Say yes only to this." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/elicit-connect value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="head asks to found the place {name} in {dir}: a root key made in your keychain, reads bounded, nothing it may write. Say yes only to this." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/elicit-place value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="head asks to found your place at {dir} — a root key made in your keychain, reads bounded, nothing it may write — to connect {source} to it from {document}, compiled once and pinned, to prove access to it where its document declares how, on head-s page or at its provider, and to let head read {source} until {until}: no read of it asks again before then, and anything that is not a read still does. Say yes only to all of it; a place elsewhere, named as you like, can be founded instead." at=policy:head/access/0.1.4 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/elicit-first-run value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="head asks to use {origin}: a place of its own at {dir}, read-only — nothing that is not a read is ever called there — its document found where {origin} publishes it and compiled, and reads granted until {until}. Say yes only to this." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.1g by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/elicit-use value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="head asks you to sign {count} lines for {place}, made against base {base}:\n{lines}\nSay yes only to exactly these." at=policy:head/surface by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/elicit value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="head carries no transport for {origin}: nothing was called. An origin reached the way head carries — encrypted, or on this device — pays it." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.1g by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/no-transport value=lock
