bound-lock/1 about="{document} carries {scope}, which a package does not: a package names by digest, each once, the worlds its sources were compiled under and each source-s document, overlay and pin, in an order its pins rest in, and grants nothing. Nothing was connected." at=policy:head/surface/0.1.1 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/package-line value=lock
